\description{
\strong{Per-competition shortcuts over the Atrium embed API for NBL1 (Australia) (\code{website_id = 3}; men's and women's).}

Thin bindings of the parameterised \verb{atrium_*()} wrappers to this site, minted from the competition registry (sdv-py \code{tools/codegen/basketball_competitions.yaml}); the full surface stays on the \verb{atrium_*()} wrappers.
}
\details{
Season rule: calendar year, Mar-Aug (END year); conferences are competition_ids.

Errors and terms of use are those of \code{\link[=atrium_fixtures]{atrium_fixtures()}}: unofficial use of the public widget endpoint, at least 1 s between requests, not republished as release assets. The site also serves women's competitions (pass their \code{competition_id}).
}
\examples{
\donttest{
  try(nbl1_seasons())
  try(nbl1_schedule())
}
}
